                'label' => 'Verse 1',
                'kind' => 'verse',
                'num' => 1,
                'lines' => [
                    'Be thou my vision, O Lord of my heart —',
                    'naught be all else to me save that thou art:',
                    'thou my best thought, by day or by night,',
                    'waking or sleeping, thy presence my light.',
                ],
            ],
            [
                'label' => 'Verse 2',
                'kind' => 'verse',
                'num' => 2,
                'lines' => [
                    'Be Thou my Wisdom, and Thou my true Word; I',
                    'ever with Thee and Thou with me, Lord; Thou my',
                    'great Father, and I Thy true son; Thou in',
                    'me dwelling, and I with Thee one.',
                ],
            ],
            [
                'label' => 'Verse 3',
                'kind' => 'verse',
                'num' => 3,
                'lines' => [
                    'Be Thou my battle Shield, Sword for the fight; Be',
                    'Thou my Dignity, Thou my Delight; Thou my soul\'s',
                    'Shelter, Thou my high Tower: Raise Thou me',
                    'heav\'nward, O Pow\'r of my pow\'r.',
                ],
            ],
            [
                'label' => 'Verse 4',
                'kind' => 'verse',
                'num' => 4,
                'lines' => [
                    'Riches I heed not, nor man\'s empty praise,',
                    'Thou mine Inheritance, now and always: Thou and Thou',
                    'only, be first in my heart, High King',
                    'of Heaven, my Treasure Thou art.',
                ],
            ],
            [
                'label' => 'Verse 5',
                'kind' => 'verse',
                'num' => 5,
                'lines' => [
                    'High King of Heaven, my victory won, May',
                    'I reach Heav\'ns joys, O bright Heaven\'s Sun! Heart',
                    'of my own heart, whatever befall, Still be',
                    'my Vision, O Ruler of all.',
                ],
            ],
